nerd-icons.el is a library for easily using Nerd Font icons inside
Emacs.  It is an alternative to all-the-icons, and works in both the GUI
and the terminal.  In graphical Emacs, icons are rendered with Symbols
Nerd Font Mono by default, but any Nerd Font can be used by setting
nerd-icons-font-family.  In a terminal, the terminal's font must be a
Nerd Font.
